/ActualText (UX/UI Designer specializing in accessible, human-centered design, with deep experience in public sector services and consumer mobile apps. I lead the full design process, from early research and stakeholder collaboration through prototyping, testing, and developer handoff, with a focus on building design systems and making complex services easier to use. My work has directly improved user completion rates on high-stakes public services, and I thrive in agile teams working closely with developers to turn ideas into shipped, accessible products.)
